r issues to mitigate risks and prevent escalation. Regularly review and adjust priorities based on impact and urgency.\n\n### 6. Overall Team Capacity and Workload Balance\n- **Current Workload**: The team is facing an increasing number of open issues with a slower resolution rate, suggesting a potential imbalance in workload.\n\n**Recommendation**:\n- Assess team capacity and consider redistributing tasks or increasing team size to balance workload and improve efficiency.\n\n## Conclusion\nTo improve process efficiency, focus on closing the gap between ticket creation and resolution, reduce resolution times, and maintain a sustainable burn rate. Prioritize high-impact issues and ensure the team has the necessary resources and capacity to manage workload effectively."
